# Environment files live under server/ (see server/.env.development.example and server/.env.production.example).
# Copy the example that matches how you run the app:
#
#   Local dev:  copy server\.env.development.example → server\.env.development
#   Local prod smoke test: copy server\.env.production.example → server\.env.production
#
# Render: set the same keys in the web service Environment tab (no file upload).
